# Portfolio performance

- Prefer server components on the home page. Keep `"use client"` only for interactive bits (header scroll spy, theme toggle, hero CTA).
- Do not add framer-motion (or similar animation libraries) — use CSS (`animate-fade-up`, hover transforms) with `prefers-reduced-motion` respect.
- Scroll may use a subtle one-shot reveal (`ScrollReveal` / `.scroll-reveal`) on project cards. Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`. Content already on screen at mount must render immediately (`is-instant`).
